<title>USA: TABLE-Waban June same-store sales up 0.1pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Waban June same-store sales up 0.1pct.</headline>
<dateline>NATICK, Mass. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five weeks ended		Percent change</p>
<p>		July 5 1997   July 6 1996     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>BJ's		$317.5     $289.0	+9.9	 +3.8</p>
<p>Homebase	   161.1	166.7	-3.4	 -6.3</p>
<p>Total		478.6	455.7	+5.0	 +0.1</p>
<p>		    Twenty-two weeks ended	 Percent change</p>
<p>		July 5 1997   July 6 1996     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>BJ's	    $1,245.0   $1,153.5	+7.9	 +1.7</p>
<p>Homebase	   670.5	665.8	+0.7	 -2.2</p>
<p>Total	    1,915.5    1,819.3	+5.3	 +0.3</p>
<p>	  NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Full company name is Waban Inc</p>
<p>BJ's stands for Waban's BJ's Wholesale Club division</p>
